### 1. 创建订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "address": "宿舍楼A栋301室",
  "phone": "13812345678",
  "note": "不要放辣",
  "items": [
    {
      "dishId": 4,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "dishId": 5,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 获取所有订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### 3. 获取用户订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/user/2

### 4. 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/page?page=0&size=10&sort=orderTime&dir=desc

### 5. 支付订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/2/pay?paymentMethod=WECHAT

### 6. 开始准备
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/2/prepare

### 7. 开始配送
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/2/deliver

### 8. 完成订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/2/complete

### 9. 搜索订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/search?keyword=宿舍

### 10. 获取统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/stats

### 11. 获取用户统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/stats/user/2